  "description": "The Vaporesso Dojo Blast 30K Pro redefines the \"Big Puff\" vaping experience, combining massive capacity with advanced customisation features usually reserved for premium refillable kits. Powered by an impressive 1200mAh rechargeable battery, this device is rated for up to 30,000 puffs, making it one of the longest-lasting prefilled options available. Offering a premium alternative to basic pod systems, the Dojo Blast 30K Pro features a fully integrated digital screen that displays your battery level and current power setting. It is the first pod kit in its class to offer a 3-level power adjustment system—Eco, Normal, and Power—allowing you to switch between extended battery life and intensified flavour with a simple flick of the control. The kit delivers its impressive puff count by including a double supply of e-liquid in every package. Each box includes two 2ml prefilled pods and two 8ml refill containers. This smart \"Pod + Refill\" mechanism keeps the mesh coils saturated via Vaporesso’s COREX Dual Mesh technology, ensuring smooth draws and consistent flavour from the first puff to the last. Wrapped in a sleek and stylish satin metallic chassis, the Dojo Blast 30K Pro looks and feels as good as it tastes, and is available in 15 flavour editions. Vaporesso Dojo Blast 30K Pro Kit Flavours • Lemon Lime A classic citrus pairing of sharp, zesty Lemon and bright Lime. • Blueberry Sour Raspberry Sweet Blueberry meets tangy Raspberry with a sharp, sour kick. • Pineapple Ice Juicy tropical Pineapple finished with a refreshing blast of Ice. • Fizzy Cherry Bold, ripe Cherry notes with a sparkling, soda-style finish. • Watermelon Ice The fresh, sweet taste of Watermelon cooled by a breeze of Ice. • Blue Razz Lemonade Tangy Blue Raspberry blended into a zesty, bubbly Lemonade. • Pink Lemonade A summer favourite mixing sweet Raspberry with sharp, citrusy Lemonade. • Strawberry Ice Ripe, juicy Strawberry lifted by a crisp, cooling Ice exhale. • Blueberry A deep and rich single-note fruit flavour capturing fresh Blueberries. • Cool Menthol A clean, crisp, no-nonsense Menthol blend for pure refreshment. • Blueberry Edition A dedicated collection focusing on rich and sweet Blueberry profiles. • Strawberry Edition A celebration of sweet, ripe, and juicy Strawberry notes. • Cherry Edition A bold selection highlighting the deep and tart taste of Cherry. • Lemon Edition A zesty and vibrant profile centred around sharp Lemon citrus. • Pineapple Edition An exotic and juicy flavour profile dominated by golden Pineapple. Shop Dojo Blast 10k + 30K Refill Pods",
